44272	44275	44277	44277	Laertes	202	" Surprisingly ! "
44279	44296	44303	44303	she	233	" it seems as if nothing else had ever such a tang of wormwood in it . "
44297	44302	44326	44326	she	233	" As little wormwood , "
44306	44324	44326	44326	she	233	" as any gift that a man may enjoy without envy and without conceit . But now , "
