44550	44555	44556	44556	he	234	" Quit the child ! "
44564	44575	44750	44750	Wilhelm	234	" or one of us shall never leave this spot ! "
44759	44794	44846	44846	he	1453	" You shall neither see nor touch her , till you have explained before a magistrate where you stole her . I will pursue you to every extremity . You shall not escape me . "
