45065	45071	45072	45072	he	200	" People laugh at us , "
45075	45107	45336	45339	the " Great Devil	6995	" and admire our feats of skill ; but their admiration does nothing for us . The master has to pay us , and may raise the funds where he pleases . "
45337	45341	45895	45896	our friend	674	" Great Devil . "
45742	45892	46019	46019	Wilhelm	234	" What actor , what author , nay , what man of any class , would not regard himself as on the summit of his wishes , could he , by a noble saying or a worthy action , produce so universal an impression ? What a precious emotion would it give , if one could disseminate generous , exalted , manly feelings with electric force and speed , and rouse assembled thousands into such rapture , as these people , by their bodily alertness , have done ! If one could communicate to thronging multitudes a fellow - feeling in all that belongs to man , by the portraying of happiness and misery , of wisdom and folly , nay , of absurdity and silliness ; could kindle and thrill their inmost souls , and set their stagnant nature into movement , free , vehement , and pure ! "
46010	46017	46019	46019	Wilhelm	234	" Where hast thou been hid ? "
46026	46037	46056	46056	Laertes	202	" Thou hast given us a great deal of anxiety . "
46048	46054	46070	46071	the child	1278	" Thou art ours now , "
46058	46068	46083	46084	the other	6355	" we have bought thee . "--"For how much ? "
46075	46081	46102	46102	she	6355	" For a hundred ducats , "
46086	46101	46123	46123	she	6355	" pay them again , and thou art free . "--"Is that very much ? "
46105	46122	46434	46437	the lady - manager	7006	" Oh , yes ! thou must now be a good child . "--"I will try , "
46414	46424	47172	47172	Melina	190	" the lady - manager and the other actors , "
47161	47170	47172	47172	Melina	190	" What a happy man could I be , "
47174	47224	47850	47850	she	233	" had I but two hundred crowns , to get into my hands , for a beginning , these fundamental necessaries of a theatre ! How soon should I get up a little playhouse , that would draw contributions from the town and neighborhood , and maintain us all ! "
