106884	106942	106858	106858	Aurelia	242	" My mother dying early , the fairest years of my youth were spent with an aunt , whose principle it was to despise the laws of decency . She resigned herself headlong to every impulse , careless whether the object of it proved her tyrant or her slave , so she might forget herself in wild enjoyment .
