107414	107496	107505	107505	Wilhelm	234	" So you are again at ' Hamlet ' ? Very good ! Many doubts have arisen in me , which seem not a little to impair the canonical aspect of the play as you would have it viewed . The English themselves have admitted that its chief interest concludes with the third act ; the last two lagging sorrily on , and scarcely uniting with the rest : and certainly about the end it seems to stand stock - still . "
