119000	119080	119099	119099	She	3859	" that not only so much that is impossible should be denied us , but so much also that is possible ! It was not your lot to meet with a faithful heart that would have formed your perfect happiness . It was mine to fix the welfare of my life upon a hapless creature , whom , by the weight of my fidelity , I drew to the bottom like a reed , perhaps even broke in pieces ! "
