184421	184512	184623	184624	the physician	8225	" give no one any hint of it : we shall come upon the fair one 's footsteps , never fear . At present I am anxious only for Lothario : the case is dangerous ; the kindliness and comfortable talking of the doctor tells me so . We should be quit of Lydia , for here she does no good ; but how to set about the task I know not . To - night I am looking for our old physician : we shall then take further counsel . "
