185872	185879	185932	185932	he	234	" With children it may do , "
185883	185931	185932	185932	he	234	" for we love them tenderly , and take an open charge of them . But with our equals , in behalf of whom our heart is not so sure to call upon us for forbearance , it might frequently be dangerous . Yet do not think , "
185941	186062	186077	186077	Jarno	223	" that I purpose to decline the task on this account . Honoring your judgment as I do , feeling such attachment to your noble friend , such eagerness to forward his recovery by whatever means , I willingly forget myself and my opinions . It is not enough that we can risk our life to serve a friend : in the hour of need , we should also yield him our convictions . Our dearest passions , our best wishes , we are bound to sacrifice in helping him . I undertake the charge ; though it is easy to foresee the pain I shall have to suffer , from the tears , from the despair , of Lydia . "
