186079	186136	186287	186287	she	301	" Fräulein Theresa , whom you get acquainted with , is a lady such as you will rarely see . She puts many a man to shame ; I may say , she is a genuine Amazon : while others are but pretty counterfeits , that wander up and down the world in that ambiguous dress . "
